WEBVTT

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:13.570
Murakami-senpai, what's wrong?

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:18.700
This is Mochizuki-san's favorite photographer.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:21.150
I wonder if she already has this.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:25.560
It really is a mystery.

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:25.960
Huh?

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.940
Aren't you and Mochizuki-senpai

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:31.960
complete opposites?

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:36.630
I've always found it mysterious
that you two are so close.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:40.880
I've been wondering the same thing!

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:43.090
They could end up being like water and oil.

00:00:43.090 --> 00:00:47.520
Or playing like cats and dogs! How weird!

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:51.930
Chloe-san, the saying is 
"fighting like cats and dogs."

00:00:51.930 --> 00:00:54.320
Everyone makes mistakes!

00:00:55.430 --> 00:01:00.080
I suppose it might seem strange to others, though.

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:03.640
Knowing the sort of person Mochizuki-san is...

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:07.720
The sweat rolling off her body...

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:09.210
The sparkle of youth...

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:10.560
Tantalizing!

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:12.590
Absolutely tantalizing!

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:17.550
Oh, Mochizuki-senpai.

00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:20.090
Hey there, Kokomi-chan.

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:21.600
How's it going?

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:24.980
Thanks for asking. My performance 
is getting a lot more consistent.

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:27.980
I'm going to shoot the tournament, too,

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:29.080
so do your best.

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:30.090
R-Right!

00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:31.730
Oh!

00:01:32.630 --> 00:01:34.000
Cosmos.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:35.690
It must be fall.

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:38.800
I think I'll take some to Fumio-chan.

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:40.900
To Murakami-senpai?

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:44.700
Yeah, Fumio-chan likes pressed flowers.

00:01:45.220 --> 00:01:46.830
Not really surprising, huh?

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:49.820
Hm?

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:51.840
Is there something on my face?

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:55.070
No, I'm just a little surprised that

00:01:55.070 --> 00:01:58.220
you and Murakami-senpai are friends.

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:00.090
We get that a lot.

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:02.810
When did you two become friends?

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:07.760
The day our fated meeting 
took place was... Oh, yes.

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:11.440
It was just a little while after 
we started at this school...

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:44.910
<b>Cameras and Shortcake</b>

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:55.100
The next stop is <b>Yomikiri Land</b>

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:04.990
<i>It's June already...</i>

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:08.120
<i>I need to start giving serious thought</i>

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:10.930
<i>to what I'm going to submit 
for the photo contest.</i>

00:04:13.590 --> 00:04:15.310
There, there.

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:17.920
Excuse me...

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:21.010
You can sit here if you'd like.

00:04:21.010 --> 00:04:22.280
Sorry about that.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:24.070
Thank you.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:25.950
There, there.

00:04:27.650 --> 00:04:31.920
<i>It takes more courage than you'd think 
to do something nice like that.</i>

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:33.080
<i>Oh...</i>

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:38.710
Did you drop this?

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:43.260
Now, don't do that.

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:46.220
It's all right.

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:51.250
The next stop is <b>Shinkikyougaoka</b>

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:58.650
<i>Now that I get a good look 
at her, she's really pretty.</i>

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:04.950
<i>Nice...</i>

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:07.580
<i>So nice...</i>

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:13.440
<b>Super cute!!</b>

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:13.450
Fumio Murakami-chan?

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:14.410
Yeah.

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:16.170
She's a first-year like us,

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:17.910
and on the library committee.

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:23.140
I can't believe I didn't have a girl 
as cute as her on my radar.

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:23.730
Okay!

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:24.840
Now that I know who she is,

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:27.000
I'm going to ask her to model for me!

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:27.840
Model?

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:33.100
Yeah! I'm going to ask her to model for 
the photo contest I'm going to enter.

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:36.210
I think that might be a little difficult.

00:05:36.210 --> 00:05:37.690
Huh? Why?

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:41.800
She's always reading by herself during breaks...

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:44.550
She's kind of hard to approach.

00:05:44.550 --> 00:05:46.760
Her hobbies are reading and pressed flowers,

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:50.620
and she's introverted and doesn't 
say much, according to my sources.

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:54.810
In the past, she was asked to model for

00:05:54.810 --> 00:05:56.920
the arts and crafts club, but she ran away.

00:05:56.920 --> 00:05:58.870
Really?

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:02.150
<b>Super cute!!</b>

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:04.440
She sounds great!

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:07.120
She's a cool and mysterious beauty!

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:09.970
I'm totally motivated now!

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:12.440
Sneak, sneak.

00:06:13.380 --> 00:06:14.060
Sneak, sneak!

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:19.280
Did I surprise you,

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:21.070
Fumio Murakami-chan?

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:23.900
I'm Erena Mochizuki from the photography club.

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:25.600
Nice to meet you!

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:27.070
Oh, from this morning...

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:28.990
Huh? You remember me?

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:31.710
Yes. And, um...

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:35.000
I forgot to thank you for this morning.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:35.760
Huh?

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:39.960
Thank you for picking up my bookmark.

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:42.750
You were worried about that?

00:06:45.390 --> 00:06:48.300
<i>I totally want to take this girl's picture!</i>

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:51.540
You're great, Fumio-chan! You're great!

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:53.470
U-Uh...

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:55.680
Fumio-chan, I have a favor to ask you!

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:59.690
Will you be the model for a photo 
I'm entering in a contest?

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:02.020
Model?

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:06.480
I know I'll be able to take some 
great pictures if you're my model!

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:08.820
No, I couldn't...

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:10.300
Leave it to me.

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:13.000
I'll take such pretty photos 
of you, you'll be shocked!

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:14.980
Look forward to it!

00:07:14.980 --> 00:07:16.240
No, but...

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:19.500
I can see it...

00:07:19.720 --> 00:07:21.000
I can see it!

00:07:21.230 --> 00:07:24.040
I see the greatest pose!

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:27.130
I haven't said anything yet...

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:37.180
Fumio-chan, good morning.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:44.560
Fumio-chan.

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:48.530
Fumio-chan!

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:49.780
Snap!

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:55.910
Fumio-chan!

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:57.660
Got it.

00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:09.040
<i>I should have turned her down,</i>

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:10.920
<i>but I just got caught up in her rhythm.</i>

00:08:11.740 --> 00:08:15.140
<i>Mochizuki-san seems like 
she's having so much fun...</i>

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:21.140
Mochizuki-san?

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:24.100
A young girl bathed in the light of sunset...

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:27.270
It makes the perfect picture!

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:29.080
Right...

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:36.230
I'm so happy I get to go 
home with you, Fumio-chan.

00:08:39.390 --> 00:08:43.360
Come to think of it, you're by 
yourself a lot, aren't you?

00:08:43.360 --> 00:08:43.920
Huh?

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:46.760
Well, I appreciate that since 
it makes it easier for me

00:08:46.760 --> 00:08:48.400
to get the perfect picture, but...

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:52.670
Are you not into hanging out with other girls?

00:08:53.140 --> 00:08:56.440
Well, it's not that I like being alone, exactly.

00:08:56.440 --> 00:08:59.660
I just end up getting absorbed in my books...

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:01.500
I see.

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:08.810
Fumio-chan!

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:12.850
Aw, so close!

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:15.880
That was a great expression just now.

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:17.280
I-I'm sorry.

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:21.790
I'd like to capture you with a more natural smile,

00:09:22.350 --> 00:09:25.590
but I'm just not that great at this yet.

00:09:30.390 --> 00:09:34.340
<i>I still couldn't tell her today...</i>

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:46.760
<i>I'd like to capture you with a more natural smile...</i>

00:09:51.260 --> 00:09:55.510
I have to refuse Mochizuki-san tomorrow for sure.

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:00.190
Ready!

00:10:00.190 --> 00:10:01.950
Fight! Oh! Fight! Oh!

00:10:02.430 --> 00:10:05.200
That's great! That's great, Fumio-chan!

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:07.680
That's a great expression!

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:13.740
Um... Mochizuki-san.

00:10:13.740 --> 00:10:16.550
Isn't this shot nice?

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:18.380
Hey, what do you think?

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:21.390
I really like this one.

00:10:22.030 --> 00:10:25.250
I'm going to take one at this angle next time.

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:26.220
Mochizuki-san.

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:28.100
Yes?

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:30.770
You're going to disturb other people,

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:33.260
so please keep quiet in the library.

00:10:33.260 --> 00:10:34.720
Sorry about that.

00:10:34.720 --> 00:10:38.300
But, look! Isn't this picture really cute?

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:40.200
Look, look...

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:41.780
I'm sor—

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:43.430
That was mean.

00:10:43.430 --> 00:10:45.740
There was no reason to hit me.

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:51.280
Please stop.

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:52.000
Huh?

00:10:52.490 --> 00:10:54.760
Please stop taking pictures.

00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:55.920
Okay.

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:58.630
I won't take any more pictures in the library.

00:10:59.140 --> 00:11:02.140
How about taking pictures at your house?

00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:05.280
I could get a shot of you relaxing in your room.

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:08.860
I'd also get to meet your mom.

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:12.150
That's not what I meant.

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:15.360
I've been wanting to tell you...

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:15.900
Huh?

00:11:17.220 --> 00:11:19.400
I can't be your model.

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:27.660
I see.

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:29.540
You didn't want to be my model...

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:32.790
No, it's not that I didn't want—

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:37.050
I thought maybe you were enjoying it.

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:41.800
I guess I wasn't getting anywhere after all.

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:57.780
<i>I didn't mean to say it like that...</i>

00:11:58.270 --> 00:11:59.570
Wait! Wait!

00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:01.820
Let me in.

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:03.520
You're soaking wet.

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:04.980
You're going to catch a cold.

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:06.910
I forgot my umbrella.

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:09.410
That's just like you, Mochizuki-chan.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.540
I'll see you later.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:23.550
<b>Shinkikyougaoka Summerfest</b>

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:23.550
<b>Photography 
Contest</b>

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:38.570
Mom

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:38.570
You forgot your lunch.
 That's unusual for you.

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:42.810
<i>I couldn't tell Mochizuki-san what I really wanted to.</i>

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:47.990
<i>But it'd be better for her</i>

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:50.210
<i>to get a good picture for her contest.</i>

00:12:50.210 --> 00:12:55.720
The chocolate at that shop is really good.

00:12:57.140 --> 00:12:59.130
<i>I'm sure Mochizuki-san</i>

00:13:00.780 --> 00:13:02.200
<i>will be fine.</i>

00:13:11.380 --> 00:13:14.310
Hey, Murakami-san's in the cafeteria.

00:13:14.760 --> 00:13:16.800
You're not going to take pictures of her?

00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:18.190
Huh? The cafeteria?

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:19.540
Yeah.

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:22.440
It's unusual to see her there.

00:13:23.060 --> 00:13:25.950
<i>Is she trying to avoid me?</i>

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:31.500
What are you sighing for?

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:34.200
Well, I was rejected.

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:34.910
What?

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:35.960
You were in love?

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:37.710
Rejected by who?

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:39.500
Fumio-chan...

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:40.460
What?!

00:13:40.760 --> 00:13:43.770
She told me she couldn't be my model.

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:46.090
Oh, that's what you meant.

00:13:46.600 --> 00:13:49.160
I thought we'd gotten to be good friends,

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:51.340
but I think she might hate me now...

00:13:51.340 --> 00:13:53.460
Maybe it can't be helped.

00:13:53.460 --> 00:13:56.670
I don't think Murakami-san's
 really cut out to be a model.

00:13:56.670 --> 00:14:00.460
Yeah, she's quiet and not very expressive.

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:01.230
Huh?

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:02.830
I bet she wanted to turn you down,

00:14:02.830 --> 00:14:05.240
but couldn't bring herself to say it.

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:07.360
You think so?

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:13.420
So you'll have to start looking 
for a replacement model, huh?

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:14.970
Yeah.

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:17.830
If there's anyone you're 
interested in, I'll introduce you.

00:14:18.930 --> 00:14:19.720
Okay...

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:24.650
<i>This is for the best, isn't it?</i>

00:14:27.490 --> 00:14:30.120
But I'll have to decline.

00:14:30.120 --> 00:14:30.640
Huh?

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:35.530
Fumio-chan was the one who really 
inspired me to take pictures.

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:39.440
So I can't switch to another girl just like that.

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:47.190
Fumio-chan...

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:54.080
So you were on duty today?

00:14:54.650 --> 00:14:57.960
Yeah, I have Wednesday and Friday.

00:14:57.960 --> 00:14:59.470
I see.

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:06.840
Sorry about before.

00:15:07.160 --> 00:15:08.070
Huh?

00:15:08.070 --> 00:15:09.300
I mean...

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:11.660
When I hit your camera.

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:13.590
I didn't mean to...

00:15:13.590 --> 00:15:15.200
Don't worry.

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:17.640
It won't break from something like that.

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:19.400
Really?

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:20.690
I'm glad.

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:24.020
You really never change, do you, Fumio-chan?

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:25.190
Huh?

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:28.460
That reminded me of when we first met.

00:15:28.980 --> 00:15:33.570
You know, when you went out of your 
way to thank me, even after the fact.

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:35.450
Oh, yeah.

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:37.820
Thank you for today.

00:15:37.820 --> 00:15:41.110
I need to head to the photo studio,

00:15:41.110 --> 00:15:42.110
so I'll see you later.

00:15:42.110 --> 00:15:43.000
Um...

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:43.580
Hm?

00:15:44.910 --> 00:15:47.520
I hope you find a model.

00:15:47.520 --> 00:15:48.400
Huh?

00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:50.800
I know it's weird for me to say that, but...

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:55.350
Actually, I was thinking of quitting this time.

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:56.350
Huh?

00:15:56.670 --> 00:15:58.050
I don't mean it that way.

00:15:58.050 --> 00:16:00.550
I wasn't really ready for it in the first place.

00:16:00.550 --> 00:16:03.730
There'll be other contests, anyway.

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:05.810
See you next week.

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:18.330
<i>Should I really just leave things like this?</i>

00:16:19.480 --> 00:16:22.120
<i>I was thinking of quitting this time.</i>

00:16:32.480 --> 00:16:33.990
<i>Is this really...</i>

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:43.890
Erena Mochizuki

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:43.890
Want to go on a date tomorrow?

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:43.890
<b>Here</b>

00:16:56.210 --> 00:16:57.930
Fumio-chan!

00:17:00.400 --> 00:17:01.210
Um...

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:03.190
Never mind, just have a seat.

00:17:03.650 --> 00:17:07.640
The cakes here look really good.

00:17:07.640 --> 00:17:09.800
Want to get something to 
eat, since we're here?

00:17:09.800 --> 00:17:11.490
I'll pay today.

00:17:11.490 --> 00:17:13.020
Huh? But...

00:17:13.020 --> 00:17:15.090
My apology for the library.

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:17.550
Do you not like cake, Fumio-chan?

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:18.510
No...

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:20.510
<b>Tiramisu                        Mont Blanc</b>

00:17:18.940 --> 00:17:20.510
Let's have some, then.

00:17:22.670 --> 00:17:24.890
Mochizuki-san, I...

00:17:26.070 --> 00:17:26.900
You've decided?

00:17:29.890 --> 00:17:31.730
I'll have the strawberry shortcake.

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:37.950
Excuse me, could we get a strawberry 
shortcake and a gâteau au chocolat?

00:17:38.390 --> 00:17:39.700
Okay!

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:42.280
I did it again...

00:17:42.280 --> 00:17:45.320
I made you order cake, didn't I?

00:17:45.320 --> 00:17:47.710
I know I need to fix that habit...

00:17:48.070 --> 00:17:51.710
The moment I think something sounds 
good, I just push ahead with it.

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:00.240
I'm sorry for forcing you to model

00:18:00.240 --> 00:18:03.720
without realizing you 
didn't really want to do it!

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:04.220
Huh?

00:18:05.120 --> 00:18:07.230
I never properly apologized...

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:11.190
Thank you for waiting.

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:14.840
Here's your strawberry shortcake 
and gâteau au chocolat.

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:18.660
Hey, are you Sasahara-san from Class D?

00:18:19.190 --> 00:18:19.870
Yes?

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:22.550
I'm Erena Mochizuki from Class C.

00:18:22.550 --> 00:18:23.160
Oh!

00:18:23.650 --> 00:18:25.560
You work here part-time?

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:26.560
Yeah.

00:18:26.560 --> 00:18:28.800
My grandpa owns this shop.

00:18:28.800 --> 00:18:29.960
That sounds nice.

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:31.860
Do you get to eat all the cake you want?

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:34.370
He takes it out of my pay.

00:18:34.370 --> 00:18:36.380
I see!

00:18:36.860 --> 00:18:38.390
Enjoy.

00:18:38.390 --> 00:18:40.010
Thank you.

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:41.350
Well, let's eat.

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:43.260
It'll get cold if we don't eat it now.

00:18:44.360 --> 00:18:46.960
Wait. I guess cakes don't get cold...

00:18:47.750 --> 00:18:49.770
You're amazing, Mochizuki-san.

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:51.020
Huh?

00:18:51.670 --> 00:18:55.050
You can say what's on your mind, 
and you act on your thoughts.

00:18:55.050 --> 00:18:57.860
I always just sit and think to myself.

00:18:59.940 --> 00:19:01.910
You're amazing yourself, Fumio-chan.

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:02.960
Huh?

00:19:03.770 --> 00:19:05.910
I'm digging in.

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:13.330
I will, too.

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:18.690
This is good!

00:19:21.240 --> 00:19:25.260
I had you come today because
 I wanted to ask you a favor.

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:28.090
A favor?

00:19:28.090 --> 00:19:30.960
Please let me take your picture!

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:32.490
But...

00:19:32.490 --> 00:19:34.260
It has nothing to do with the contest.

00:19:34.260 --> 00:19:36.020
I just want to take your picture, Fumio-chan!

00:19:37.660 --> 00:19:40.280
You're going to give up on the contest?

00:19:40.850 --> 00:19:43.410
That's not it, really.

00:19:43.960 --> 00:19:47.240
There's no point in submitting 
a photo I'm not happy with.

00:19:47.970 --> 00:19:49.250
I photograph what I want to.

00:19:49.920 --> 00:19:53.380
And right now, that's you, Fumio-chan.

00:19:53.780 --> 00:19:55.610
Why me?

00:19:56.210 --> 00:20:01.200
You said just now that all you 
do is think to yourself, right?

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:01.510
Yeah.

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:05.070
I don't think that's true at all.

00:20:05.070 --> 00:20:07.720
It might take some time,

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:10.520
but if something's important 
to you, you'll tell me, right?

00:20:11.160 --> 00:20:14.580
I love that about you.

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:17.760
That isn't true.

00:20:17.760 --> 00:20:21.590
There's something I haven't told you...

00:20:21.590 --> 00:20:22.880
What is it?

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:25.860
I think you've misunderstood my reason

00:20:25.860 --> 00:20:27.660
for not wanting to be your model.

00:20:30.640 --> 00:20:32.610
It's not that I don't want 
you to take my picture,

00:20:32.610 --> 00:20:35.340
or that I think you forced me to do it.

00:20:35.850 --> 00:20:39.680
I just don't think I can be of any help to you.

00:20:39.680 --> 00:20:40.760
Why?

00:20:41.320 --> 00:20:44.620
I'm not good at smiling happily, posing,

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:47.560
or expressing my emotions...

00:20:47.560 --> 00:20:49.160
You'd get a better picture

00:20:49.160 --> 00:20:54.350
if you got someone who can deal with 
being in front people to be your model.

00:20:55.290 --> 00:20:56.160
That's why...

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:59.820
So that was it?

00:21:02.060 --> 00:21:04.900
What makes a good picture?

00:21:05.400 --> 00:21:07.830
I'm still trying to figure that out.

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:09.490
But...

00:21:10.490 --> 00:21:11.510
Look at this.

00:21:15.280 --> 00:21:17.670
That's a good picture, don't you think?

00:21:18.320 --> 00:21:21.580
So this is how I look when I smile...

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:23.800
You like shortcake, huh?

00:21:24.610 --> 00:21:25.170
Yeah.

00:21:25.660 --> 00:21:28.680
Fumio-chan, you have lots 
of different expressions.

00:21:29.110 --> 00:21:33.180
I'm sure there are plenty of wonderful things 
about yourself you haven't noticed.

00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:35.920
I get really excited when I'm taking your picture,

00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:40.060
and I want everyone to know how great you are.

00:21:40.720 --> 00:21:42.720
I might not be the best photographer,

00:21:42.720 --> 00:21:44.470
but I want to take a picture of <i>you,</i>

00:21:44.470 --> 00:21:47.070
one where you're being yourself, 
and not faking anything.

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:51.580
Mochizuki-san, you've really been 
watching me closely, huh?

00:21:51.900 --> 00:21:54.360
It was unrequited love at first sight.

00:21:54.360 --> 00:21:56.580
I watch you every chance I get.

00:21:59.470 --> 00:22:02.330
Can you still make the contest?

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:02.800
Huh?

00:22:07.290 --> 00:22:08.840
Of course!

00:22:12.160 --> 00:22:15.050
Did you know there was a 
girl this cute at our school?

00:22:15.050 --> 00:22:17.110
I never knew she could look like that.

00:22:16.520 --> 00:22:20.260
<b>Winner</b>

00:22:16.520 --> 00:22:20.260
Erena Mochizuki

00:22:17.110 --> 00:22:19.130
I thought she was more cool and collected.

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:26.000
<i>Looking back now, I'm grateful 
that she asked me to model.</i>

00:22:26.400 --> 00:22:29.250
<i>I think I was able to put myself out there a little</i>

00:22:29.250 --> 00:22:32.510
<i>because Mochizuki-san helped pull me out.</i>

00:22:30.410 --> 00:22:33.270
<b>Award
Winner
</b>Erena Mochizuki

00:24:09.920 --> 00:24:24.770
<b>Preview</b>

00:24:10.740 --> 00:24:12.420
Kinoko Himejima here.

00:24:12.420 --> 00:24:14.860
Do you like bamboo shoots or mushrooms more?

00:24:14.860 --> 00:24:16.630
I like mushrooms more, I think.

00:24:16.630 --> 00:24:18.910
It's cool how they seem so mysterious.

00:24:18.910 --> 00:24:22.350
More on that next time in: Cats and a Rainy Night.

00:24:19.680 --> 00:24:24.770
<b>Episode 4: Cats and a Rainy Night</b>

00:24:22.350 --> 00:24:23.690
I'll be waiting for you.
